  "scope": "Four independently modeled exteriors that represent the story’s building subjects across the two campuses. Motions Road includes the Aviation Hall and Sir Keith Park Station. Great North Road includes the Western Springs Pumping Station and Te Puawānanga Science and Technology Centre. The tramway and exhibit objects are museum context."
